# A bare name alone may be a scalar typed by mistake: the `from` fix is not certain.
mode: syntax
---- query
orders
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..7
  PIPELINE@0..6
    NAME_REF@0..6
      IDENT@0..6 "orders"
  WHITESPACE@6..7 "\n"

error[DS0150]: a query starts with `from`
  --> query:1:1
  |
1 | orders
  | ^^^^^^ read this table with `from`
  |
  = help: if `orders` is a table, read it with `from`: `from orders`
